    "title": "Auntie Anne\u2019s Rewards",
    "description": "Get exclusive coupons and special rewards, earn points towards free pretzels, and place contactless mobile orders for delivery or pickup (curbside pickup where available). The Auntie Anne\u2019s Pretzel Perks app lets you earn points toward free pretzels with every purchase \u2013 Oh how sweet (or salty) it is!\r\n\r\nREWARDS:\r\n---------\r\nEnjoy a free pretzel after your first purchase (minimum $1)!\r\n*Free pretzel on your birthday.\r\nEarn 10 points for every dollar spent.\r\nFree pretzel every 250 points.\r\nExclusive offers and fun surprises.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n---------\r\nContactless Mobile Ordering\r\nRewards & Coupons\r\nStore Locator\r\nPoints Tracker\r\nFull Menu Listing\r\n\r\nCA Privacy Notice: https://www.auntieannes.com/caprivacy\r\nDo Not Sell My Info: https://www.auntieannes.com/donotsell\r\n\r\n*Terms and conditions may apply",
